Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 11:28:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] test(ui): re-render egui_app_light and egui_tool_editor on
 Windows

PR #58 committed both goldens rendered on another platform. On Windows,
where every gate tier runs, they differed only by anti-aliasing noise:
5,248 / 7,145 pixels under threshold 0.4, 1 / 4 pixels past 0.6, none
past 1.0; the diff image shows isolated pixels and no layout change.
Re-rendered with UPDATE_SNAPSHOTS=1; camcraft-ui lib 217 passed.

Fixes #66

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
